{"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","author_sig":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","data":{"body":"RP-01 S4 CI Verified -1 (patchset 1): oracle's AC-1/AC-2 real-OTel nesting test failed under REBAR_REQUIRE_EXTRAS=1 — the extra-coverage guard (bug 599e) forbids importorskip-dodging in the require-extras lane, and [tracing] (opentelemetry.sdk) wasn't installed there. Fix: added --extra tracing to the require-extras pytest lane install in .github/workflows/_build-and-test.yml (opentelemetry-sdk/api already pinned in uv.lock; small pure-python wheels). This upgrades AC-1/AC-2 from CI-skip to real coverage. Verified locally with REBAR_REQUIRE_EXTRAS=1 armed: 8/8 green. Amended, pushed patchset 2 to change 1837."},"env_id":"b8a354e0-12c3-4cf2-bbf1-fcc9685d5126","event_type":"COMMENT","timestamp":1786969949393271001,"uuid":"2a381507-32e6-493c-a69c-bb68861f17ba"}